{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/web/src/knowledge/KnowledgeFrame.vue",
    "title": "知识阅读帧与固定引用解析",
    "summary": "根据 trail 帧类型呈现知识正文、原始材料或引用目标，并在引用不可用时展示关系、原因和明确的降级状态。",
    "category": "implementation",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "frame-routing",
        "title": "帧类型与异步解析",
        "body": "组件把 knowledge 帧交给正文阅读器，把 source 帧交给材料阅读器；citation 帧则从序列化 id 中取 document、revision 和 citation 参数，请求固定引用。generation 计数避免较早请求晚到后覆盖当前帧，成功时还向上层回报可读标题。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "citation-presentation",
        "title": "引用语义与不可用状态",
        "body": "引用关系被翻译为“支持论点”“实现依据”等人类可读标签，并与引用理由一起显示。若目标不可操作或无法解析，界面保留该引用并说明不可用原因；可用目标则按 article 或 material 分流，材料阅读器同时接收 digest 和精确行号。[[c2]] 该组件负责单帧内容，不包含帧栈、焦点归还或滚动记忆本身。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "知识帧解析与请求防竞态",
        "reason": "支持按帧类型路由、解析 citation 参数以及用 generation 防止过期响应覆盖当前状态。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/web/src/knowledge/KnowledgeFrame.vue",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 18
        },
        "quote": "<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { computed, ref, watch } from \"vue\";\nimport { OmBadge, OmEmpty } from \"@omem/ui\";\nimport KnowledgeDocument from \"./KnowledgeDocument.vue\";\nimport KnowledgeSource from \"./KnowledgeSource.vue\";\nimport { knowledgeApi, type Citation, type KnowledgeFrame } from \"./api\";\nconst props = definePr"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "引用理由与目标渲染",
        "reason": "支持显示人类可读关系、不可用原因，并将文章或材料目标交给对应阅读器。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/web/src/knowledge/KnowledgeFrame.vue",
          "startLine": 20,
          "endLine": 34
        },
        "quote": "<template>\n  <KnowledgeDocument v-if=\"frame.kind === 'knowledge'\" :prefix=\"prefix\" :document-key=\"String(parsed.key)\" :revision=\"parsed.revision ? String(parsed.revision) : undefined\" :section=\"parsed.section ? String(parsed.section) : undefined\" @navigate=\"emit('navigate', $event)\" @loaded=\"emit('loaded', $event)\" />\n"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "快速切换帧时，旧请求虽然不会写入状态，但是否需要主动取消以减少资源消耗？",
        "why": "generation 只阻止过期结果生效，材料没有显示 AbortController 或其他网络取消机制。",
        "nextStep": "在高延迟环境做快速导航测试；若存在明显冗余请求，再为知识 API 增加可取消信号。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c1"
        ]
      }
    ]
